    "summary": "When you pick this model for your army, you must pick one of these keywords. The model gets that keyword, and the change listed for it, for the rest of the battle:\n\n- **KHORNE**: its hellforged weapons get +2 S\n- **TZEENTCH**: its **infernal cannon** gets +3 A\n- **NURGLE**: it gets +1 T\n- **SLAANESH**: it gets +2\" M",
